                                "example_id": "7ac06573-3752-4832-8cd4-181af5b57746",
                                "sense_id": "8eae91e9-018f-37ef-a07d-e93264eb7ab4",
                                "text": "де́лать что́-либо с большо́й тща́тельностью",
                                "translation": "do something with great care; do something very carefully/thoroughly",
                                "english": "do something with great care; do something very carefully/thoroughly"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f68905a2-6ba1-4249-92c1-7aa8512ee133",
                                "sense_id": "8eae91e9-018f-37ef-a07d-e93264eb7ab4",
                                "text": "тща́тельность рабо́ты",
                                "translation": "thoroughness of the work",
                                "english": "thoroughness of the work"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "518d78a9-1215-47bc-adf1-058f88b0e39d",
                                "sense_id": "8eae91e9-018f-37ef-a07d-e93264eb7ab4",
                                "text": "Ры́бников не пропуска́л ни одного́ солда́та, отдава́вшего ему́ честь, и сам прикла́дывал ру́ку к козырьку́ фура́жки с осо́бенно продолжи́тельной, аффекти́рованной тща́тельностью.",
                                "translation": "Ribnikov did not miss a single soldier who gave him a salute as he passed. He put his hand to the peak of his cap with a peculiarly prolonged and exaggerated care.",
                                "english": "Ribnikov did not miss a single soldier who gave him a salute as he passed. He put his hand to the peak of his cap with a peculiarly prolonged and exaggerated care."
